          "nmt_worse": [
            "mistranslated prepositions (all directions)",
            "ambiguous source words (all directions)",
            "English continuous and perfect tenses"
          ],
          "caveat": "Ambiguous-word translation is a word-sense problem (S3) and NMT is worse at it in every direction, while improving on morphology and order (S2). The asymmetry is in the predicted direction, but the source reports no MQM-category rates, so no value is encoded."
